      "createdAt": "2026-10-02T21:39:43.187934005+00:00",
      "description": "Comment comments on Paragraph (comment → paragraph). Essay-local for now; expected to become a core \"agent commentary on human content\" mechanism when a second consumer appears (owner, 2026-10-02).",
      "id": "607009b0-310c-4eda-aad2-d079884ff85c",
      "irreflexive": true,
